{"title":"Muppet Versions of Xmas Movie Posters","link":"https://kottke.org/25/12/muppet-versions-of-xmas-movie-posters","date":1766603704000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48074-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48074-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48074-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1255\" height=\"914\" alt=\"Oscar the Grouch as Buddy the Elf on the Elf poster; and Animal as Clark Griswold on the National Lampoon's Christmas Vacation poster\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48074-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48074-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48074-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"928\" height=\"1386\" alt=\"Beaker as John McClane on the Die Hard poster\" /></p>\n\n<p>RiotGrlErin made <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/riotgrlerin.bsky.social/post/3maqhgepcp22n\">some great mashups of Christmas movie posters featuring Muppets</a>. I think my favorite is Oscar the Elf but the Die Hard one is so good too. Many more <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/riotgrlerin.bsky.social/post/3maqhgepcp22n\">in this thread</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/movies\">movies</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/remix\">remix</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/The%20Muppets\">The Muppets</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/12/muppet-versions-of-xmas-movie-posters\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723"